From dbfb7a90e0a53ab69234d3da7820260b8604da32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chlcony <72945153+Chlcony@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:08:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(display): save display arrangements and choose the main
 display

Adds a strip of saved arrangements to the top of the Displays section and
a star beside each display that makes it the main one. Applying an
arrangement moves the screens and keeps the current main display;
starring a display changes the main display and keeps the arrangement.
